
  [1mError handling.[0m Unknown hostname → development plus a [38;5;153mconsole.warn[39m naming the unrecognized host, so the fallback is
  never silent. If [38;5;153mapp.js[39m runs and [38;5;153mwindow.AppSettings[39m is absent (script tags out of order), [38;5;153mlogin()[39m throws a named error
  rather than yielding [38;5;153mundefined[39m deep in a URL string.

  [1mTesting.[0m This is where I need one more decision. [38;5;153mresolveEnvironment(hostname)[39m is a pure function and the natural thing
